          <div type="edition" xml:lang="kan-Latn" rendition="class:kannada maturity:middle">
              <p>
                  <lb n="1"/>svasti samasta-bhuvanāśraya-śrī-pr̥thvī-vallabha-mahārājādhirāja-paramēśvara-para
                  <lb n="2" break="no"/>ma-bhaṭṭārakaṁ satyāśraya-kuḷa-tiḷakaṁ cāḷukyābharaṇaṁ śrīmad-āhavamalladēva
              </p>
              
              <ab>kanda <g type="punctuation" ref="sym:doubleBar">.</g></ab>
              
              <lg n="1" met="kanda">
                  <l n="a"><lb n="3"/>makara-kari-nikara-karahata</l>
                  <l n="b">-vikarṇna-tungattaraṁga-saṁgata-śiśira</l>
                  <l n="c">-prakara ga<lb n="4" break="no"/>bhīrāṁbhōnidhi</l>
                  <l n="d">-nikāya-parivr̥ta-samasta-vasudhā-taḷa<supplied reason="undefined" evidence="previouseditor">mā</supplied></l>
              </lg>
              
              <lg n="2" met="kanda">
                  <l n="a">sētu himādriyi<lb n="5" break="no"/>n astā</l>
                  <l n="b" enjamb="yes">drī-taṭad’ indu-daya-śaiḷadiṁd’ esed’ akhiḷakṣ</l>
                  <l n="c" enjamb="yes">mātaḷama pratipāḷisi</l>
                  <l n="d" enjamb="yes">nītiyo<lb n="6" break="no"/>ḷāḷd’ esedan intu taila-narēṁdraṁ <g type="punctuation" ref="sym:doubleBar">.</g></l>
              </lg>
              
              <ab>vacana <g type="punctuation" ref="sym:doubleBar">.</g></ab>
              
              <p>int’ āhavamalladēva-vijaya-rājyam utta
                  <lb n="7" break="no"/>rottarābhivr̥ddhige saluttire tatpāda padmōpajīvi svasti-samadhi-gata-paṁca-mahā
                  <lb n="8" break="no"/>śabda-mahā-sāmantaṁ pratyakṣa-bhōriśramaṁ pusiy illad’ ātaṁ nerevoḍe gaṇḍaṁ kada
                  <lb n="9" break="no"/>na-pracaṇḍaṁ kaṭaka-prakāraṁ giri-durgga-mallaṁ raṇavīraṁ śrīmad-āhavamalla-dēva-pāda-paṁka
                  <lb n="10" break="no"/>ja-bhramaraṁ śrīmat sōbhan’ arasar· <g type="punctuation" ref="sym:doubleBar">.</g>
              </p>
              
              <ab>kanda <g type="punctuation" ref="sym:doubleBar">.</g></ab>
              
              <lg n="3" met="kanda">
                  <l n="a">Āhavamallana besadiṁd’</l>
                  <l n="b">āhava-raṁgadoḷ a<lb n="11"/>tyugra-vairi-narēṁdra</l>
                  <l n="c"> vyōhama nāḍind’ iṟid’ ut</l>
                  <l n="d" enjamb="yes">sāha-guṇōdayade negaḻdan ī raṇa-vī<lb n="12" break="no"/>raṁ <g type="punctuation" ref="sym:doubleBar">.</g></l>
              </lg>
              
              <ab>vacana <g type="punctuation" ref="sym:doubleBar">.</g></ab>
              
              <p>int’ enisi sōbhanarasar· śrī ballav arasara prasādōpalabdhiyiṁ Era
                  <lb n="13" break="no"/>ḍ’ āṟu-nūṟumaṁ banavāsi pannicchāsiramumaṁ nirākuḷam āḷuttire
              </p>
              
              <p>svasti samasta praśasti sa
                  <lb n="14"/>hitaṁ śrīmat· sāviyaṇnaṁ sōbhanarasara dayiyiṁ kukkanūr mūvattavan āḷu
                  <lb n="15" break="no"/>tt’ ire
              </p>
              
              <p>svasti <choice><orig>saka</orig><reg>śaka</reg></choice>-kāḷa 913 neya khara saṁvatsarada kārtika bahuḷa da<choice><orig>sa</orig><reg>śa</reg></choice>mi budha
                  <lb n="16" break="no"/>vārad’ andu baṁkāpurada nelevīḍinoḷ·
              </p>
              
              <p>svasti yama-niyama-<choice><orig>sā</orig><reg>svā</reg></choice>dhyāya-<choice><orig>mō</orig><reg>mau</reg></choice>nānuṣṭhā
                  <lb n="17" break="no"/>na-samādhi-saṁpannar appa śrīmat-kāḷadālūru-siddhēśvara-saṁkarāśi-bhaṭṭārara śiṣya
              </p>
              
              <ab><lb n="18"/>kandaṁ <g type="punctuation" ref="sym:doubleBar">.</g></ab>
              
              <lg n="4" met="kanda">
                  <l n="a">hariṇa-dhara-dharaṇa-caraṇāṁ</l>
                  <l n="b" enjamb="yes">buruhāḷigaḷ aghamadēbha-vairigaḷ ārggaṁ</l>
                  <l n="c">piriyariva<lb n="19" break="no"/>r enis’ esedar</l>
                  <l n="d">ddhareyoḷ negaḻd’ iḻdar amr̥ta-rāśi-munīśvarar· <g type="punctuation" ref="sym:doubleBar">.</g></l>
              </lg>
              
              <ab>vacana <g type="punctuation" ref="sym:doubleBar">.</g></ab>
              
              <p>int’ enisi negaḻd’ am<choice><sic>r̥u</sic><corr>r̥</corr></choice>ta-rāsi
                  <lb n="20"/>-bhaḻārargge sōbhanarasar ttaḻekalla nāgalēsvarakke kālaṁ kaḻci koṭṭu keyya mattar· 400 dēva
                  <lb n="21" break="no"/>geyuṁge pudōṇṭamuṁ polakke sīmayā GAP dosede māḍaḷ vannasu ttēṁkal liṁgada ka
                  <lb n="22" break="no"/>l· paḍukaḍigal· paḍuva liṁgada kala baḍagal· GAP pola mere holada sīmey int’ idak a
                  <lb n="23" break="no"/><gap reason="undefined" extent="unknown"/>sōbhanarasar ttaḻekallan agrahāra biḍu canda-dēvara
                  <gap reason="undefined" extent="unknown"/>di<gap reason="undefined" extent="unknown"/>pa<gap reason="undefined" extent="unknown"/>biṭṭa<gap reason="undefined" extent="unknown"/>
                  <lb n="24"/><gap reason="undefined" extent="unknown"/>rasar mmanam ella pēḻe kuttuṁbiḻiyidak’ aṟuvaṇaṁ<gap reason="undefined" extent="unknown"/><supplied reason="lost" evidence="parallel">a</supplied> mr̥
                  <lb n="25" break="no"/>a-rāsi-bhaṭṭārara śiṣya-sūryyābharaṇa-bhaḻārara sthanakara<gap reason="undefined" extent="unknown"/>naḷi
                  <lb n="26"/><gap reason="undefined" extent="unknown"/>le goravara mārggad’ ālūri<gap reason="undefined" extent="unknown"/>
              </p>
